{"data":{"rateLimit":{"remaining":4853,"resetAt":"2026-08-13T12:15:26Z"},"repository":{"mergeCommitAllowed":true,"squashMergeAllowed":true,"rebaseMergeAllowed":true,"pullRequest":{"id":"PR_kwDOTnxGBc7-jTvR","number":202,"title":"feat(desktop): thread declared-plans rail (ACP snapshot per agent)","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nOpen threads now show a **persistent right rail** of declared plans — one card per participating agent, never a shared backlog. Authority is the latest ACP `sessionUpdate: plan` snapshot (`entries[]`), with the existing structured todo / `plan:todo` tool as same-agent fallback only. Missing signal is muted **Plan unknown**, not a guessed checklist.\n\nFounder already chose variant A. B (in-stream cards) and C (header pills) are rejected, not deferred. This is not Mission #151, not a shared task store, and not Workbench #186 (the rail may be reused there later).\n\n### Related issue\nFixes #190\n\n## Spike 0\n\nLive Hermes / Claude / Codex adapters were **not on this VM**. Findings (in-repo evidence, labeled as such) are in `docs/crew/spikes/0025-acp-plan-live-wire.md`:\n\n- Observer already forwards raw `plan` frames as `acp_read` *before* `handle_session_update`. The `\"plan\"` arm previously only logged. This PR retains the structured snapshot on the ACP client.\n- Binding key reused: `(agentPubkey, conversationId)` — same as session ledger / `sessionAgingStore`.\n- Codex: native `entries[]` from in-repo parser evidence. Claude native plan: **unknown**. Grok / buzz-agent: **unknown**. Hermes native `entries[]` documented in-tree, not live-captured.\n\n## What changed\n\n- `buzz-acp` parses and retains `entries[]` (empty list clears; unstructured markdown `content` is not a snapshot). `session/new` drops the dead session’s plan.\n- Desktop projects one `AgentDeclaredPlan` per agent/thread from observer live + archive windows. Latest full replacement wins. Stale-lineage / failed `session/load` uses the new session, not the dead one.\n- Thread pane mounts a Crew-owned rail (`ThreadPanelDeclaredPlansBody`). Sleeping / disconnected keep last-declared and say so. `{text, done}` maps to completed/pending and does **not** invent `in_progress`.\n- Mission Inbox gains no plan rows.\n\n## Testing\n\n- ACP: retain entries, empty-list clear, `session/new` drops previous snapshot.\n- Desktop projection: two Hermes agents stay independent; wholesale replace including removals; empty clear; no markdown guess; identical text stays two rows; sleep keeps last-declared; stale session unknown; todo-tool no cross-agent merge; conversation isolation.\n- Rail render: one card per agent, dashed unknown, disabled checkboxes, `← in_progress`.\n- Mission Inbox: `\"Plan updated\"` stays ordinary working attention, not a declared-plan row.\n- Sticky status bar contract updated to follow `ProjectThreadWorkspacePanel` into `ThreadPanelDeclaredPlansBody` (still outside the scroll region).\n\n## Thin-fork\n\nNew Crew-owned files for parse/projection/rail. Upstream `acp.rs` is a small retain/clear hook; `MessageThreadPanel.tsx` is a one-wrapper mount (line count 1007 → 1004). See D-056 and UPSTREAM-SYNC.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-2a0eb66b-02f7-4d38-b7d5-48b7a3f883ec?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-2a0eb66b-02f7-4d38-b7d5-48b7a3f883ec&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n","url":"https://github.com/Nuncio-hq/crew/pull/202","state":"MERGED","isDraft":false,"mergeable":"UNKNOWN","mergeStateStatus":"UNKNOWN","reviewDecision":null,"additions":1952,"deletions":29,"changedFiles":21,"headRefName":"cursor/thread-declared-plans-rail-83ec","baseRefName":"main","createdAt":"2026-08-13T11:26:51Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-13T11:52:35Z","author":{"login":"oscarlehuu"},"comments":{"nodes":[]},"reviews":{"nodes":[]},"reviewThreads":{"nodes":[]},"history":{"nodes":[{"commit":{"oid":"420b3d59ff765c7ac57a0bcafec8e02abd97ed5e","messageHeadline":"feat(desktop): thread declared-plans rail (ACP snapshot per agent)","committedDate":"2026-08-13T11:26:06Z","additions":1925,"deletions":18,"author":{"name":"Cursor Agent","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com"}}},{"commit":{"oid":"5955d4eb2f187268878de951268544973bb1a5ec","messageHeadline":"test(desktop): follow status-bar mount into declared-plans body","committedDate":"2026-08-13T11:41:38Z","additions":27,"deletions":11,"author":{"name":"Cursor Agent","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com"}}}]},"files":{"nodes":[{"path":"crates/buzz-acp/src/acp.rs","additions":91,"deletions":0,"viewerViewedState":"UNVIEWED"},{"path":"crates/buzz-acp/src/declared_plan.rs","additions":202,"deletions":0,"viewerViewedState":"UNVIEWED"},{"path":"crates/buzz-acp/src/lib.rs","additions":1,"deletions":0,"viewerViewedState":"UNVIEWED"},{"path":"desktop/scripts/file-size-baselines.json","additions":3,"deletions":3,"viewerViewedState":"UNVIEWED"},{"path":"desktop/src/features/agents/declaredPlanProjection.test.mjs","additions":340,"deletions":0,"viewerViewedState":"UNVIEWED"},{"path":"desktop/src/features/agents/declaredPlanProjection.ts","additions":180,"deletions":0,"viewerViewedState":"UNVIEWED"},{"path":"de